{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53951","headline":"颂黄陵断际禅师（题拟） · 裴休","name":"颂黄陵断际禅师（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尘劳迥脱事非常，紧把绳头系一场。\n不是一番寒彻骨，争得梅花扑鼻香。\n（见《大正新修大藏经》第四八册裴休撰《黄陵断际禅师宛陵录》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53951.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53951","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}